  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "1000601",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Knights of Favonius Headquarters",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060101": {
            "id": "100060101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Durin! So this is where you've been!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060102"
            ]
          },
          "100060102": {
            "id": "100060102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "#Oh, {NICKNAME}, Paimon. What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060103"
            ]
          },
          "100060103": {
            "id": "100060103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, the real question is, what are you doing cooped up in here reading a book? The weather's nice out there, y'know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060104"
            ]
          },
          "100060104": {
            "id": "100060104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "Oh. Well, ever since I've had more chances to interact with the people of Mondstadt, I've been having trouble telling when people are joking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060105"
            ]
          },
          "100060105": {
            "id": "100060105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "For example, I saw a beautiful flower the last time I was at the florist. So, I told the shopkeeper, and she said:",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060106"
            ]
          },
          "100060106": {
            "id": "100060106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "\"Hehe, if you like these weeds so much, you should add some Mint and Sweet Flowers, and make it a bouquet.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060107"
            ]
          },
          "100060107": {
            "id": "100060107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "So I did as she said. But when I showed her the finished bouquet, she gave me a frankly terrifying look...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060110"
            ]
          },
          "100060110": {
            "id": "100060110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "Later, Albedo opined that this happened because I have trouble understanding the \"meaning behind words.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060111"
            ]
          },
          "100060111": {
            "id": "100060111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "So, after I learned the Mondstadt script, he told me I could come here and read.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060112"
            ]
          },
          "100060112": {
            "id": "100060112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "I was born from a storybook, so I felt that these books might be able to teach me more about the \"rules\" of this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060113"
            ]
          },
          "100060113": {
            "id": "100060113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "And, well, I guess I lost track of time... So, um, did you guys need something?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1000607",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Durin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060701": {
            "id": "100060701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "Ahem... And that's all Master Rhinedottir has to say. *coughs*...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060702"
            ]
          },
          "100060702": {
            "id": "100060702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Good work, Sebas. Can't be easy being you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060703"
            ]
          },
          "100060703": {
            "id": "100060703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Heh. A cat that can imitate someone else's voice is just as strange to witness as the first time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060704"
            ]
          },
          "100060704": {
            "id": "100060704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "Well, do not be so shocked. I am hardly an ordinary cat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1000609",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Durin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060901": {
            "id": "100060901",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "In fact, from a biological standpoint, I am no cat at all, but rather, an alchemical being. You wouldn't consider yourself a Specter simply because you float in the air like one, surely...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060902"
            ]
          },
          "100060902": {
            "id": "100060902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A Specter? What are you trying to say, mister?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060903"
            ]
          },
          "100060903": {
            "id": "100060903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "Oh, I know! Sebas is implying that you're—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060904"
            ]
          },
          "100060904": {
            "id": "100060904",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Maybe don't finish that thought, Durin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060905"
            ]
          },
          "100060905": {
            "id": "100060905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What thought? Hey!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060906"
            ]
          },
          "100060906": {
            "id": "100060906",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "Oh, and considering how Master Rhinedottir's message ended, I suppose this technique is useless now. I'll just destroy it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060907"
            ]
          },
          "100060907": {
            "id": "100060907",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "Few and far between are the people that can make her reconsider. Quite the impressive feat, young man.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060908"
            ]
          },
          "100060908": {
            "id": "100060908",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "With that done, I'll be going now. I have another message to pass along. Perhaps we'll meet again sometime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1000602",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Durin",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060501": {
            "id": "100060501",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"This is the first time we're meeting, so I'm not sure how to address you. But since you're M's child, I suppose I'll stick with 'Mini Durin.'\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060502"
            ]
          },
          "100060502": {
            "id": "100060502",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"Though you appear smaller than the Durin that came before you, that same strength flows through your veins — not a drop less.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060503"
            ]
          },
          "100060503": {
            "id": "100060503",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"He was a child of 'Humus,' an incomplete creation. Thus, he lacked the 'will' to control his own strength.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060504"
            ]
          },
          "100060504": {
            "id": "100060504",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"Yet this power was beyond what he could withstand, and so it twisted him, consumed him, thus sealing his ultimate fate.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060505"
            ]
          },
          "100060505": {
            "id": "100060505",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"Albedo claims that you have transcended this tainted blood, becoming a being much like himself. That is his opinion. I remain unconvinced.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060506"
            ]
          },
          "100060506": {
            "id": "100060506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"I trust only the facts, only that which I 'see' for myself. So take this chance, child of M. Prove yourself to me.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1000608",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the attacking monsters",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060801": {
            "id": "100060801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Ahem... And that's all Master Rhinedottir has to say. *coughs*...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060802"
            ]
          },
          "100060802": {
            "id": "100060802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Uh, could we get a self-introduction, at least?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060803"
            ]
          },
          "100060803": {
            "id": "100060803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! We're used to talking cats at this point, but one that can imitate someone else's voice... That's a first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060804"
            ]
          },
          "100060804": {
            "id": "100060804",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "I don't see how that's important, but if you must know... I am Sebas, a simple butler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060805"
            ]
          },
          "100060805": {
            "id": "100060805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Sebas",
            "text": "You're friends of Albedo, yes? Strictly speaking, I am his \"elder.\" So, make no mistake — I am no ordinary cat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
