    {
      "subId": "1000602",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060201": {
            "id": "100060201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ahhh! Where are we? Did this stupid dictionary transport us to some weird place again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060202"
            ]
          },
          "100060202": {
            "id": "100060202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "My mom's scent... I sense it here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060203"
            ]
          },
          "100060203": {
            "id": "100060203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, here comes a strange cat!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1000606",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100060601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100060601": {
            "id": "100060601",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"Hmm. Looks like Albedo wasn't mistaken after all.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060602"
            ]
          },
          "100060602": {
            "id": "100060602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Next time, maybe don't ambush us with a bunch of monsters just to prove a point!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060603"
            ]
          },
          "100060603": {
            "id": "100060603",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "Still, I do feel like I can control my power more freely now that we've defeated them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060604"
            ]
          },
          "100060604": {
            "id": "100060604",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"After hearing about you, I prepared a technique that would seal the dark power in your blood. I had planned to take this opportunity to pass it on to you.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060605"
            ]
          },
          "100060605": {
            "id": "100060605",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"Of course, using it comes with a price. While it would maintain your existence in Teyvat, it would also weaken your connection to this world.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060606"
            ]
          },
          "100060606": {
            "id": "100060606",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"And you are M's child, when all is said and done. How could I allow that uncontrolled power to send you down the same path as the child who came before you?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060607"
            ]
          },
          "100060607": {
            "id": "100060607",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"But seeing you now, it appears my concerns were misplaced. M was a terrific mother, and a far more capable one than I.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060608"
            ]
          },
          "100060608": {
            "id": "100060608",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"And I must admit, I'm rather curious to see how far you can go — how will you, an alchemical being truly integrated with this world, find your place in human society?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060609"
            ]
          },
          "100060609": {
            "id": "100060609",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "\"Rhinedottir\"",
            "text": "\"I've never conducted an experiment like this before. As such, you may yet hold the key to some unexpected answers.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060610"
            ]
          },
          "100060610": {
            "id": "100060610",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! You've got one thing wrong there. Durin's not an experiment! He's our friend!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100060611"
            ]
          },
          "100060611": {
            "id": "100060611",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "I'm not sure I understand, but... I appreciate your kindness, Aunt Rhinedottir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1000699",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "100069901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "100069901": {
            "id": "100069901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ahhh! Where did all these monsters come from!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100069902"
            ]
          },
          "100069902": {
            "id": "100069902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "Is this the proof you need, Aunt Rhinedottir? Very well. I'll show you what I can do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100069903"
            ]
          },
          "100069903": {
            "id": "100069903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "The power within me is surging to the surface...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "100069904"
            ]
          },
          "100069904": {
            "id": "100069904",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Durin",
            "text": "This is... getting easier!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
